{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14233270.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233270","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1423327001:0":{"text":"そろそろ、オーロナさんと約束した時間ですね。銀月の祭壇に行きましょう。","source_cn":"到了跟欧罗娜约定的时间了，我们去银月祭庭找她吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC10BAD0E5F2E5014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14233280.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233280","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1423328001:0":{"text":"オーロナさんがいました！もう準備は万端のようですね。","source_cn":"那是欧罗娜！她好像准备得很充分呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D72512850B22CA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14233290.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233290","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1423329001:1":{"text":"あ、来たのね！事前に色々調べておいたのよ。調理器具とか、他にも使えそうなものを用意したわ。","source_cn":"你们来啦！我提前做了一些功课，查阅了书籍，带了炊具……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB3B430653ECC86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423329002:1":{"text":"地図を見たんだけど、月没の昇降機から恵の平民街に行けるそうよ。だから、今日はそっちから行ってみない？","source_cn":"我看了地图，月落升降井处的升降机可以通往泽被平民区，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51F6CBEF120EFD7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423329003:1":{"text":"オーロナさんの方がガイドみたいですね。","source_cn":"感觉欧罗娜都可以为我们带路了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37F122EDF1ED6E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423329004:1":{"text":"その道なら、ロンロンたちも知ってます！早速行きましょう！","source_cn":"那条路线我们也很熟悉！我们出发吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9A303203FEC8337","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"オーロナ","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14233300.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233300","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1423330001:0":{"text":"ここが平民たちの暮らしている場所……ボロボロで、泥だらけ……雨風を凌ぐこともできない……","source_cn":"这里就是平民生活的地方……泥泞，破败，连遮风挡雨都做不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x302FB39F33464E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_