:{"text":"あれは、事故だよ、事故！次はもっと安全な場所に隠れるし……","source_cn":"那只是个意外！大不了我下次藏在不那么偏僻的地方嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F89818F8D78CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423338007:1":{"text":"いくらあなたたちが子どもで、遊び盛りだとしても、ずっと遊んでるわけにはいかないでしょ？","source_cn":"你们这么大的年纪，虽然可以尽情享受游戏的乐趣，但也不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABE9BD1E0CF2AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423338008:1":{"text":"たまには落ち着いて本を読んで、勉強しないと……","source_cn":"也该抽时间安静下来，读一些书，学点东西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE698E2127D601B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423338009:1":{"text":"……？何を言ってるの？","source_cn":"她说的是什么意思啊？我听不懂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC25FDA5292070ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423338010:1":{"text":"どうせ大人になっても、よくて貴族の使用人になるだけだし。勉強したって意味ないし……","source_cn":"反正我们长大后最好的出路不过是去当贵族的仆从，学你说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B5C0B76D3087A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423338011:1":{"text":"使用人？でも、王都はもう……","source_cn":"仆从？可是现在王城已经……","status":"matched","hash_xx