:1423340005:1":{"text":"はぁ、あの子たちったら……","source_cn":"唉，真是让人不省心的孩子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738C8F7010B0381A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423340006:1":{"text":"よかったら、あの子たちについて教えてくれる？","source_cn":"那几个孩子的情况……可以跟我们说说吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34AFFFCA326237FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423340007:1":{"text":"……みんな、親のいない孤児でね。小さい頃から生きるために苦労してるのよ。私たちも、たまに手を貸したりはするけど……","source_cn":"……他们都是无父无母的孤儿，从小在山野里摸爬滚生存，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C7495B4E1E99081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423340008:1":{"text":"ヒナっていう子がリーダーで、ヒナのお母さんは、彼女を生んですぐに使用人として王都入りしたんだけど、それっきり帰ってきてないの……","source_cn":"那个领头的女孩叫希娜。希娜的母亲在生下希娜后去王城当了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5790AEFACC2B6CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423340009:1":{"text":"怖い物なしで運動神経もいいから、この辺の子どもたちはヒナの言うことしか聞かないのよ。","source_cn":"希娜胆子大，又身手矫健，如今是这些孩子的头儿，可以说，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA64B7EB4A0C8BEF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423340010:1":{"text":"でも、頑固とい