015:1":{"text":"子ども……平民街には、彼らを受け入れて勉強を教えてくれる学校や先生はいないの？","source_cn":"这些孩子……平民区没有学校和老师愿意接收他们，让他们学习吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EC3111FF89ACCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423340016:1":{"text":"司祭や貴族みたいなお金持ちならともかく、私たち平民が学校に通ったり、先生に教えてもらうなんて、そんな贅沢できるわけないわ。","source_cn":"学校、老师……这些都是祭司贵族之类的富裕人家才能负担得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC87C0041767A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1423340017:1":{"text":"それに、こんなところに来てくれる先生なんていないから……","source_cn":"而且，不会有老师愿意来这里的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E694962049AEEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1423340018:1":{"text":"なるほどね……","source_cn":"原来是这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75901F66C2633FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1423340019:0":{"text":"子どもたちの状況を知り、あなたたちは気が重くなった……","source_cn":"知道了这些孩子的真实情况后，气氛一时有些凝重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAF2C027FD684A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423340020:1":{"text":"ごめんなさい……今の私たちでは何も力になれなくて……もう遅いですし、オーロナさんをお家まで送りましょう？","sour