:""},"say:4:1423342002:1":{"text":"たぶん、あの子に私を重ねたのかも……","source_cn":"可能因为我觉得那些孩子和我很像吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2420B9DEBF5830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423342003:1":{"text":"以前の私は、司祭になることしか頭になかった。迷った時は、ひたすら本を読んで……そうしていると、不思議と悩みも忘れられたの。","source_cn":"以前的我只有努力成为祭司这一个念头，迷茫的时候都会逼自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8361A6CC2866B70B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423342004:1":{"text":"でも、何もかも最初からやり直さなきゃならなくなった時……自分は何も出来ないんだって思い知らされた……","source_cn":"现在要抛弃作为祭司学到的一切重新开始……却发现自己什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E08BEF98D2BDB83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423342005:1":{"text":"目指す場所も、将来何をすればいいのかも分からない。目の前の変化に、まだ適応する準備ができていない……あの子たちも、同じ気持ちなんじゃないかな。","source_cn":"……迷茫，无处可去，不知道未来该做什么，觉得自己没有准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AEF2489BA69009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423342006:1":{"text":"私は、あなたたちと出会えて、平民街へ行く夢が叶って、一歩踏み出す勇気までもらえた……でも、あの子たちには、そこまでしてくれる人がいない……","source_cn":"但我起码遇到了你们，你们帮助我实现了去平民区看看的愿望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B54F2DFAA0618B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1423342006":{"text":"私は、あなたたちと出会えて、平民街へ行く夢が叶って、一歩踏み出す勇気までもらえた……でも、あの子たちには、そこまでしてくれる人がいない……","source_cn":"但我起码遇到了你们，你们帮助我实现了去平民区看看的愿望，还鼓励我迈出第一步，可那些孩子却没有这样的运气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B54F2DFAA0618B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423342007:1":{"text":"でも、自分の将来だって決まってないのに……さすがに、おこがましいんじゃないかな……？","source_cn":"可是我连自己的未来都没有想明白……我是不是太不自量力了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB410A5207A8CB42C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423342008:1":{"text":"オーロナさんは十分頑張ってますよ！それでも気分が晴れないなら、次は別の場所で気晴らししますか？","source_cn":"欧罗娜你已经很努力了！如果你还是不开心的话，不如我们下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3DCD5E180850AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423342009:1":{"text":"でも、逃げ続けるだけじゃだめな気がする……","source_cn":"这样逃避下去总不是办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC6CA51F36F746F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423342010:1":{"text":"今日はありがとう！将来のこととか、色々、もう少し考えてみる！","source_cn":"谢谢你们！我想一个人好好思考一下，关于未来的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB33A5462ED5AE34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum